# The GenAI guide, which hatch_build.py packages into the wheel that `RUN uv build`
# makes from this context. Without it an image built from a checkout carries no copy
# and `ash get-genai-guide` in it exits 1. After `docs` above, because the last
# matching line decides; tests/unit/cli/test_genai_guide_ships_with_install.py reads
# this file with Docker's matching rules.
